    "body": "Please don't use XXX here and instead of `<var>response</var>` use resource. This whole section needs to be cleaned up at some point to be more specific about that, but that's a large undertaking.\n\nThe only problem here might be for `about:srcdoc` documents and similar stuff where navigate effectively takes a response rather than a request. I guess for those we should set HTTPS state where we create the response.\n",
